<title>UK: LIFFE coffee, cocoa higher but sugar down in PM.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee, cocoa higher but sugar down in PM.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Holds most gains as NY rises after a drop in stocks certified for delivery against the exchange spark supply concerns. At 1545 GMT, July up $17 at $1,717.</p>
<p>COCOA - Up but still in a range. July up 11 at 1,000.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Aug on lows, but distant months edge up. Aug down 1.5 at 311.80.</p>
</text>
